      "title": "About Parker Russell Eastern Africa",
      "lead": "Parker Russell Eastern Africa is an independent audit, tax and advisory firm headquartered in Nairobi, supporting businesses, public sector organisations, international institutions and non-profit organisations across the region.",
      "body": "The firm combines deep regional knowledge with multidisciplinary expertise across assurance, taxation, accounting, risk, transactions and management advisory. Current branch locations include Kenya (Nairobi & Malindi), Uganda (Kampala), Rwanda (Kigali) and Somalia (Mogadishu), with assignments also supported across Tanzania, Burundi, South Sudan, Ethiopia, DR Congo, Zambia, Djibouti, Eritrea and other African markets."
    }
